music BGM14.mp3
text 5 am... Work time.
text The old man has already started baking bread, so I meet up with him, still a little groggy.
text Since the store opens at 7, we get to baking early enough to make it in time for the morning rush.
text After we open, I work the register.
text Furukawa Bread is most busy with customers between the hours of 7 and 9.
text I didn't know that until now of course, since I'd never been to the store so early.
text Because of that, work is even harder than I expected it would be.
text Sanae-san helps out in the mornings during spring break too.
text She takes the bread the old man bakes and lines it all up on store trays.
text Then she greets the customers with her natural, sociable personality.
text Watching her work is inspiring ─ she's so charming, she shines; her positive attitude infectious, even.
text I think the old man truly found an amazing person to be his wife.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSN10E"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
